title: "Research Poster Studio"
abstract: >-
  A desktop GUI and command-line application for structured layout authoring of
  academic research posters from text files (YAML + Markdown + BibTeX), with
  export to PDF, PNG, HTML, SVG, PPTX, and Markdown.
